Thanks for this. I have now fixed this in SVN. The Rdevel repository 
does not contain FLBRP, as the methods and classes there are now defined 
in FLAdvice. So try

install.packages('FLAdvice', repos="http://flr-project.org/Rdevel")

or update your copy of SVN and try FLBRP from there

Cheers,


Iago

